## 6. 与库存联动

取消订单（CANCELLED）和退款（REFUNDED）需要回补库存：

```javascript
// 取消/退款时回补库存
async function releaseStock(pool, orderId) {
  await pool.query(`
    UPDATE products p
    JOIN order_items oi ON p.id = oi.product_id
    SET p.stock = p.stock + oi.qty,
        p.version = p.version + 1
    WHERE oi.order_id = ?
  `, [orderId]);
}
```

